ower part of the iPhone screen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/close(error:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" method defined in the SmartCardConnection protocol the NFCSmartCardConnection has an additional ","type":"text"},{"code":"close(success:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method that will close the connection and set the alertMessage of the NFC alert to the provided message.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC is only supported on iPhones from iPhone 6 and forward. It will not work on iPads since there’s no NFC chip in these devices."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connection to a YubiKey (iOS only).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection establishes a connection to a YubiKey via NFC. The connection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents the system NFC dialog and waits for the user to tap their YubiKey.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connections are short-lived due to iOS timeout constraints. Perform operations quickly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and close the connection with a user-visible message.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(","    alertMessage: \"Hold your YubiKey near the phone\"",")","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()","await connection.close(message: \"Codes retrieved\")"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifi